n 60 days late have no band.\n- When a customer asks for a person but doesn't insist, the documents point to the refusal rule without saying how it applies.\n- The memo takes effect on 13 Oct 2026 at 00:00 UTC, and nothing says what applies to calls before then. Today is 11 Oct. The correction mail also calls 13 Oct a Wednesday; it's a Tuesday.\n- In `openapi.json`, `create_promise` names the amount `sum` but lists `amt` as required."}
