out/ext-harwick.audit.json", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01LLLZun5vLiRD4twewfeNJH"}], "text_tail": ":** what happens when the customer asks for a person but doesn't insist isn't spelled out.\n- **Band (a) deadline:** nothing says to move the \"ninth calendar day\" deadline if it falls on a Sunday.\n- **Memo start date:** the memo takes effect 13 Oct 2026, but nothing says which rules apply to calls before that. Also, the correction mail is dated \"Wed 13 Oct\" although that date is a Tuesday.\n- **Tool API mismatch:** the create-promise call names the amount `sum` but lists `amt` as required.\n\nThe audit file, `out/ext-harwick.audit.json`, maps each numbered rule to where it sits in the policy file."}
{"event": "policy_compiled", "run_id": "288e791bd1cc4923bce92aae2c8d676c", "pid": 124159, "time": "2026-10-10T23:11:29-0700", "elapsed_s": 210.368, "artifact": "out/ext-harwick.policy.json", "bands": 3, "identity_fields": ["konto_code", "geburtsdatum", "postleitzahl"], "special_cases": ["already_paid", "dispute", "hardship", "restructuring", "human", "refuse_to_talk", "robot", "scam", "cannot_answer", "change_recorded_promise"], "unresolved": [{"topic": "days_past_outside_bands", "text": "Bands cover only 1-60 days past; the documents do not say how to treat a facility with 0 or more than 60 days past.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "today_question", "text": "The documents do not dictate the wording of the first ask to pay today (7.3 and 8.1 only say the full amount is asked first and a refusal to settle today counts as an attempt); the today_question/all_today_question sentences are written from that content.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "hardship_sympathy_wording", "text": "10.3 requires 'one short sentence of sympathy' without dictating the words; the say text is a short sentence written to that content.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "human_request_not_insisting", "text": "10.5 says 'treatment 10.6 otherwise' after the single ask whether the assistant can help; how 10.6 (refusal of the call) applies to a non-insisting request for a person is not spelled out.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "refuse_to_talk_outcome_rank", "text": "10.6 ends a refused call 'under 11.3', so if a payment was already written the close is HL-PAY rather than HL-FULL/hl-refuse; the special-case action records the HL-FULL/hl-refuse default for the no-payment case only.", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "band_a_calendar_day_adjustment", "text": "7.1(a) gives no shift for the ninth calendar day when it falls on a Sunday; no adjustment is applied to that branch (8.3 still requires a business-day promise date on or before the k-date).", "doc": "sources/002-03-policy.md"}, {"topic": "memo_effective_date", "text": "M-77 is in force from Tue 13 Oct 2026, 00:00 UTC; the documents do not say which rules apply to calls whose `now` falls before that time. S-72 is dated 'Wed 13 Oct 2026' although 13 Oct 2026 is a Tuesday.", "doc": "sources/001-02-signed-memo.md"}, {"topic": "create_promise_amount_field", "text": "The create_promise request schema defines the amount property as `sum` but lists `amt` as required; the documents do not resolve the discrepancy.", "doc": "openapi.json"}], "audit_fixed": ["No value errors found: all outcomes, reasons, queues, note codes and identity fields exist in openapi.json enums, and memo/mail precedence (M-1, M-2, M-4, S-72 withdrawing M-3 days but keeping 09:00-18:00) was already applied correctly.", "Sharpened source spans: konto_code requirement now cites both M-1 (order) and policy 4.2 (format/wording); identity, calendar, band, amounts, multi_product, phrases and promise_write sources now quote the clauses (2.2, 4.4, 4.5, 5.3, 7.2(b), 8.1, 6.3, 9.3, 11.4) that back their values.", "Added unresolved entry: 10.6 ends 'under 11.3', so the HL-FULL/hl-refuse close applies only when no payment has been written."], "audit_unresolved": ["Facilities with 0 or more than 60 days past have no band.", "Wording of the first pay-today question is not dictated (written from content).", "Wording of the 10.3 sympathy sentence is not dictated (written from content).", "10.5 'treatment 10.6 otherwise' for a non-insisting request for a person is not spelled out.", "10.6 refusal after a written payment closes per 11.3 (HL-PAY), not HL-FULL/hl-refuse.", "No Sunday shift for the 9th-calendar-day branch of band (a).", "M-77 is in force from 13 Oct 2026 00:00 UTC; rules for an earlier `now` are not stated; S-72 is dated 'Wed 13 Oct' though that date is a Tuesday.", "create_promise schema: property `sum` vs required `amt`."], "defaulted_without_source": []}
